{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":19,"ref":"2-chronicles 25:19","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"de","chapter":25,"translation":"„Du sagst: ‚Siehe, du hast ⟨את⟩ Edom geschlagen', und ⟨dein⟩ Herz hat dich erhoben, dich zu brüsten. Nun bleib in deinem Haus! Warum willst du dich zum Bösen reizen, dass du fällst, du und Jehuda mit dir?'“","tokens":[{"surface":"אמרת","gloss":"Du sagst"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"Siehe"},{"surface":"הכית","gloss":"du hast geschlagen"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Edom"},{"surface":"אדום","gloss":"Edom"},{"surface":"ונשאך","gloss":"und ⟨dein⟩ Herz hat dich erhoben"},{"surface":"לבך","gloss":"⟨dein⟩ Herz"},{"surface":"להכביד","gloss":"dich zu brüsten"},{"surface":"עתה","gloss":"Nun"},{"surface":"שבה","gloss":"bleib"},{"surface":"בביתך","gloss":"in deinem Haus"},{"surface":"למה","gloss":"Warum"},{"surface":"תתגרה","gloss":"willst du dich reizen"},{"surface":"ברעה","gloss":"zum Bösen"},{"surface":"ונפלת","gloss":"dass du fällst"},{"surface":"אתה","gloss":"du"},{"surface":"ויהודה","gloss":"und Jehuda"},{"surface":"עמך","gloss":"mit dir"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T23:59:54.846290400Z","model":"glm-5.2"}